[{"category":"section","location":"#TowStyTemplates.jl","page":"TowStyTemplates.jl","text":"Templates for TowSty, the webapp and static site generator for Stylo.\n\nTowStyTemplates.jl is mainly based on FranklinTemplates.jl.","title":"TowStyTemplates.jl"},{"category":"section","location":"#Getting-started","page":"TowStyTemplates.jl","text":"pkg> add TowStyTemplates\n\njulia> using TowStyTemplates\njulia> newproject(\"myProject\", template=\"jj\")","title":"Getting started"},{"category":"section","location":"#List-of-templates","page":"TowStyTemplates.jl","text":"using TowStyTemplates\nusing Latexify\n\ndf = templates()\nmdtable(df, latex=false)","title":"List of templates"},{"category":"section","location":"#API","page":"TowStyTemplates.jl","text":"","title":"API"},{"category":"method","location":"#TowStyTemplates.generatehash-Tuple{String}","page":"TowStyTemplates.jl","text":"generatehash(dir::String)\n\nThis function generates a hash and writes it on a file named .hash for workspace update.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TowStyTemplates.generatehash"},{"category":"method","location":"#TowStyTemplates.mergefolders-Tuple{Any, Any}","page":"TowStyTemplates.jl","text":"mergefolders(src, dst)\n\nInternal function to looks at what's inside src/ and put it in dst/. If there are paths that match, the files are merged. It is assumed that files will not clash, if they clash files in dst are replaced.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TowStyTemplates.mergefolders"},{"category":"function","location":"#TowStyTemplates.newproject","page":"TowStyTemplates.jl","text":"newproject(dir; template=\"jj\", changedir=true)\n\nGenerate a new folder (an error is thrown if it already exists) that contains the skeleton of the blog that can be processed by TowSty. The user can specify a template out of the list of available templates. If topdir is specified as \".\" then the current directory is used.\n\ntemplate=\"jj\":  name of the template to use,\nchangedir=true: whether to change the current directory to the newly\n\ncreated folder or not.\n\nverbose=true:   whether to display information or not.\n\nExample\n\nnewproject(\"MyNewWebsite\", template=\"jj\")\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TowStyTemplates.newproject"},{"category":"method","location":"#TowStyTemplates.templates-Tuple{}","page":"TowStyTemplates.jl","text":"templates()\n\nThis function lists available templates.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TowStyTemplates.templates"}]
